    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eRailway RRB ALP Recruitment 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-11T10:13:22+05:30\"\u003eJune 11, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e10:13 am\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://indianrailways.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRailway Recruitment Board (RRB)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e has released a \u003cstrong\u003enotification\u003c/strong\u003e on \u003cstrong\u003eits official website\u003c/strong\u003e for the recruitment of \u003cstrong\u003eAssistant Loco Pilot (ALP) posts.\u003c/strong\u003e This recruitment is being conducted \u003cstrong\u003efor 11,127 vacancies.\u003c/strong\u003e The RRB application process \u003cstrong\u003ehas started on 15 May 2026,\u003c/strong\u003e and candidates can \u003cstrong\u003eapply until 14 June 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e The minimum \u003cstrong\u003eage limit is 18 years,\u003c/strong\u003e while the maximum age limit is \u003cstrong\u003e30 years as on 01 July 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e Candidates are \u003cstrong\u003eadvised to check the complete details\u003c/strong\u003e for the \u003cstrong\u003eRailway RRB ALP Recruitment 2026\u003c/strong\u003e provided below.\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e(CEN – 01/2026)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eRailway RRB ALP Online Form 2026 (11,127 Posts)\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eRailway RRB ALP Examination 2026 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/rrb-alp-2026/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOfficial Notification : \u003cstrong\u003e13 May\u0026nbsp;2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOnline Apply Start Date : \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e15 May 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOnline Apply Last Date : \u003cstrong\u003e14 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eLast Date For Fee Payment : \u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e16 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCorrection Date : 17 – 26 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam Date : \u003cstrong\u003eNotify Later\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdmit Card : \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e04 Days Before Exam\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult Date : \u003cstrong\u003eWill Be Updated Here Soon\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to confirm from the \u003cstrong\u003eRRB ALP\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eofficial website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor \u003cstrong\u003eGeneral/ OBC Candidates\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e: ₹ 500/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor \u003cstrong\u003eSC/ ST/ PwBD Ex-Serviceman Candidates : ₹ 250/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFee Refund :\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;General / OBC :\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eRs. 400/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;will be refunded and Other candidates :\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eRs. 250/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;will be refunded to the bank account after appearing in Stage I Exam.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment Mode (Online):\u003c/strong\u003e You can make the payment using the following methods:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDebit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCredit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInternet Banking\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIMPS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCash Card / Mobile Wallet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eRailway RRB ALP Notification 2026 : Age Limits As On 01 July 2026\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMinimum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e18 Years\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e30 Years\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRailway\u003c/strong\u003e provides age relaxation for the \u003cstrong\u003eRailway RRB ALP \u003c/strong\u003eposition as per their regulations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003e11,127 Posts\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eRailway RRB ALP Recruitment 2026 : Vacancy Details\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 150px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Category Wise Vacancy Details\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCategory Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo. Of Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eUR\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e4860\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOBC\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e2598\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eEWS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e1004\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eSC\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e1746\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eST\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e919\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 22.0448%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePost Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 64.6903%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 22.0448%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAssistant Loco Pilot (ALP)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 64.6903%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates must have \u003cstrong\u003epassed 10th grade\u003c/strong\u003e along with an \u003cstrong\u003eITI certificate in the relevant trade\u003c/strong\u003e or hold a \u003cstrong\u003eDiploma/Degree in Engineering\u003c/strong\u003e in the respective field.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e For Zone-wise eligibility, check the official notification…\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/CEN-01-2026-Eng-639143539720035538-24.pdf\"\u003eClick Here\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #800000;\"\u003eYou May Also Check :\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/indian-coast-guard-navik-gd-yantrik-recruitment-2025/\"\u003eIndian Coast Guard Navik GD \u0026amp; Yantrik Recruitment 2025\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Fill Railway RRB ALP Online Form 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInterested candidates who wish to apply for the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eRRB \u003c/strong\u003epost can submit their application online before\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e14 June 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eUse the click here link provided below under important link section to apply directly.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAlternatively, visit the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eofficial website of RRB \u003c/strong\u003eto complete the application process online.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMake sure to complete the application before the deadline\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://indianrailways.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e14 June\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;2026.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote –\u003c/strong\u003e छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की इस भर्ती की सभी जानकारी पिछले वर्ष की भर्ती के अनुसार दी गयी है अतः छात्रों से अनुरोध है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे । (\u003cstrong\u003eLast Date, Age Limit, \u0026amp; Education Qualification\u003c/strong\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Railway RRC ALP Recruitment 2026 : \u003c/span\u003eMode Of Selection\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCBT 1 (Computer-Based Test )\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCBT 2 (Computer-Based Test )\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCBAT (Computer-Based Aptitude Test)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDocument Verification \u0026amp; Medical Examination\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #cc0052;\"\u003eJoin Our WhatsApp Channel\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eFollow Now\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #cc0052;\"\u003eJoin Our Telegram Channel\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eFollow Now\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u